{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40520,"sections":[{"id":"script-20520","name":"原始脚本 20520","scripts":[20520],"start":0,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:1","scriptId":20520,"text":"炎热的沙漠除了该死的沙尘和一些零星的仙人掌外都看不到其他像样的风景。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:2","scriptId":20520,"text":"“好热，快点穿过这里吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:3","scriptId":20520,"text":"“说话会浪费多余的水分，我建议你少抱怨……等等，那是什么？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:4","scriptId":20520,"text":"兰布达本打算让埃普西隆闭嘴，但一个东西吸引了她的注意力。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:5","scriptId":20520,"text":"循着兰布达的视线望去，能看到侧前方的沙堆中半埋着一个物体——是补给箱。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:6","scriptId":20520,"text":"“什么嘛，不就是个破箱子么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:8","scriptId":20520,"text":"“这是个补给箱，风沙已经侵蚀了箱子的表面，看来有点年头了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20520:20520:9","scriptId":20520,"text":"“那接下来该怎么办呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":50,"right":56,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
